  "limits": [
    "Production handlers and subscriptions were exercised against a fake host/scheduler; no real Minecraft events.",
    "Late replay of an old break can create an empty fallback or recover a newer snapshot; same-tick deduplication is not global exactly-once.",
    "Spawn/delete and multi-write rollback are not atomic; failed hand rollback after docking failure can lose the item. A durable recovery protocol remains needed.",
