    "A different replacement snapshot arriving after break dispatch is preserved, but original recovery is abandoned, not guaranteed.",
    "Archive audit established PCM differences in 33 reencoded OGGs. Current 48 OGGs, masters and raw MP3s match imported baseline bytes exactly; build/check verify instead of reencoding.",
