    "No worlds, LevelDB, installed packs, external services, branches, commits or publication were changed.",
    "Lossless registry boundary deliberately refuses semantically equivalent but noncanonical external JSON and blocks the whole shard if any neighbor is unsupported. No automatic repair.",
